  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The next generation of property professionals will operate differently.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.329
    },
    {
      "text": "Not because they'll use more software, not because they'll have more dashboards, and not because AI became another tab.",
      "start": 4.88,
      "end": 11.88
    },
    {
      "text": "At a certain level of ambition, the question changes.",
      "start": 12.4,
      "end": 15.829
    },
    {
      "text": "Research, clients, reports, finance, communication.",
      "start": 16.298,
      "end": 21.206
    },
    {
      "text": "Powerful on their own.",
      "start": 21.561,
      "end": 22.985
    },
    {
      "text": "More valuable when they stop behaving like separate destinations.",
      "start": 23.36,
      "end": 27.167
    },
    {
      "text": "When intelligence can move, when context can follow, when the business can act as one.",
      "start": 27.52,
      "end": 33.783
    },
    {
      "text": "So don't ask what the next tool is.",
      "start": 34.24,
      "end": 36.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask what happens when the business becomes the system.",
      "start": 36.72,
      "end": 40.074
